<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Marshal Konev -  70,000/10 tonnes coal La Cienaga/Trieste end June $8.10 fio 25,000 shinc/10,000 shinc Deiulemar.</p>
<p>TBN - 70,000/10 Puerto Bolivar/Fos 16/30 July low $7 fio 35,000 shinc/25,000 shinc Cetragpa.</p>
<p>ORE - There were no fresh ore fixtures reported on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
